<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-13T17:55:57.496Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 17:55:57 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Houthis have intensified attacks on Saudi Arabia, striking a pumping station and the East-West oil pipeline, while Saudi forces report intercepting missiles and drones with debris falling near Mecca, which the Houthis deny targeting. Syria is weighing sending troops to aid Saudi Arabia in its war with the Houthis, and France is favouring added pressure on the Houthis, according to their foreign ministry spokesperson. Pakistan has called for an immediate end to Houthi attacks on Saudi Arabia as the UN Security Council renews Yemen sanctions, and the Houthis held a mass funeral while urging actions to protect civilians. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/10/world/middleeast/syria-weighs-sending-troops-to-aid-saudi-war-with-houthis.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE5VWWVhRjlMVjR4M2ZBOEZ2MmphcFhXc2YyZGNIUnJXOV9uX1c0Sm8yNjFoS2owVVF0UE5ENy1UMDBpZnZjdTVUOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxPOHNyWUhKaHR2QmJXUjJ6S0xNdDZnZmpKRzJQak9SWVc3cmttUGVfbk13NzBZclpqNnp5N1JFc0JYakw2Wl9hV3BYdm1mMnJQR3BKRFI2Zzh3cVRhTFFxejBSVWtTMkt2WTRGRUxFSkVocF83aFlIOU10Vk11d29TRERPcnFVWHRJYktFOUlGU0x4c0Q0UWVtT3JkUE91ZVNPQ09NTnhaMGxJajZxQnkwWTFvTzN4WnNpMTBYalNZOHFZdnUtX1VHeUVR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxON1pYX0FiYnJXVm4tV0FZcGhMb0V0Z1hGQW9HUF9yNjVfdUFBQ284Uzl6MDNjbXo4MFktbmJYaE51NFV0NzE0REk2dTlNRmR1TzFGbzBZLWtldWRfSkpjZDVGRHg